train-000455,low,b,p2_r4_audit_train-000455_b_low_173dbde32ed0,completed,True,False,True,True,ok,True,False,46368,True,True,not_checked_complex_expression,,,"\binom{a'}{c'}=\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\1&2\end{pmatrix}\binom{a}{c},|starting from \((a,c)=(1,0)\)|The nth power of this matrix has bottom-left entry \(F_{2n}\), where \(F_0=0,F_1=1\)|Therefore, after 12 pairs, the number ending at C is \(F_{24}=46368\)",artifacts\phase2\phase2_verified_cot_luna_budget5_v1\raw_responses\sync\p2_r4_audit_train-000455_b_low_173dbde32ed0.json,69f2c7ad01a8cd62199a6e72e1c82bbdcd6057f5e42a75d1fcc3fa305755c972
