train-003115,low,a,p2_r4_audit_train-003115_a_low_12588f6089e2,completed,True,False,True,True,comma_integer_output,False,True,"2023年：2,403,800辆；首次低于150万辆：2031年",False,False,comma_integer_output|comma_integer_output|label_mismatch|not_checked_complex_expression,,,"以“万辆”为单位，令2020年对应为第1项，则 a_1=300。每年保留上一年普通汽车的90%，再增加8万辆，因此递推式为 a_{n+1}=0.9a_n+8。于是 a_4=0.9^3\cdot300+8(0.9^2+0.9+1)=240.38，所以2023年约有240.38万辆，即2,403,800辆。又由递推式，a_{n+1}-80=0.9(a_n-80)，故{a_n-80}为公比0.9的等比数列，且 a_n=80+220\cdot0.9^{n-1}。要使a_n<150，需0.9^{n-1}<7/22≈0.3182。由参考值，0.9^{10}≈0.35不满足，而0.9^{11}≈0.31满足，故首次为n=12，即2031年。|直接代入a_{12}=80+220\times0.9^{11}≈148.2<150，而a_{11}=80+220\times0.9^{10}≈157>150，确认首次年份为2031年。",artifacts\phase2\phase2_verified_cot_luna_budget5_v1\raw_responses\sync\p2_r4_audit_train-003115_a_low_12588f6089e2.json,9f4dfd2882d32800e528edf55b4da34b983acc9529bc92ad7bf1f442bfa85bf6
train-003115,medium,a,p2_r4_audit_train-003115_a_medium_b4d96123d691,completed,True,False,True,True,comma_integer_output,False,True,"(1) a_1=300, a_{n+1}=0.9a_n+8; 2,403,800 cars. (2) Geometric sequence with first term 220 and ratio 0.9; first year: 2031.",False,False,comma_integer_output|comma_integer_output|label_mismatch|not_checked_complex_expression,70/220=7,,"Measure cars in units of 10,000, and let n=1 correspond to 2020|Then a_1=300|\[a_{n+1}=0.9a_n+8.\]|Thus a_4=0.9^3(300)+8(0.9^2+0.9+1)=240.38, giving 2,403,800 ordinary cars in 2023|\[a_{n+1}-80=0.9(a_n-80),\]|The condition a_n<150 is equivalent to \(0.9^{n-1}<70/220=7/22\)|Since \(0.9^{10}\approx0.35>7/22\) and \(0.9^{11}\approx0.31<7/22\), the first occurrence is n=12, corresponding to 2031|At n=11 (2030), a_{11}=80+220(0.9^{10})\approx156.7>150|at n=12 (2031), a_{12}=80+220(0.9^{11})\approx149.0<150, confirming the first year.",artifacts\phase2\phase2_verified_cot_luna_budget5_v1\raw_responses\sync\p2_r4_audit_train-003115_a_medium_b4d96123d691.json,222f27176d8af1e1f59dbc1c03f5f8e30a6c776a0bc20b742ea4fe4529402852
