train-004623,medium,a,p2_r4_audit_train-004623_a_medium_a4ba1701498c,completed,True,False,True,True,comma_integer_output,False,True,"P(t_*),\quad t_*\in\operatorname*{argmin}_{t}F(t)",False,False,comma_integer_output|comma_integer_output|label_mismatch|not_checked_complex_expression,,,"Choose coordinates with B=(0,0), A=(a,0), C=(r,s), s≠0|Write C₁=(d,0) and A₁=eC, where 0<d<a and 0<e<1|Put k=(ar-r²-s²)/s|Every admissible P≠B has the form P(t)=(x,tx), where x=(a-kt)/(1+t²)|Let h=(a+d)/2 and ρ²=r²+s². The circumcenter X(t) of APC₁ is|X=(h,(ad-dx-k tx)/(2tx))|For the circumcenter Y=(u,v) of CPA₁, set Q=(x²+t²x²+eρ²)/2|ru+sv=(1+e)ρ²/2,  xu+txv=Q,|Define F(t)=|X(t)-Y(t)|². The required point is P(t_*), where t_* is the real admissible root of F'(t)=0 giving the smallest value of F",artifacts\phase2\phase2_verified_cot_luna_budget5_v1\raw_responses\sync\p2_r4_audit_train-004623_a_medium_a4ba1701498c.json,af388f2c83949dc110bef940ab23ff179d84ba2b84aeb263bcc7fcb68e875172
