train-007339,low,b,p2_r4_audit_train-007339_b_low_dc15c8e3bf16,completed,True,False,True,True,comma_integer_output,False,True,"451, 836",False,False,comma_integer_output|comma_integer_output|label_mismatch|not_checked_complex_expression,90 + 1 = 7|167 + 1 = 7,,"The conditions n ≡ 1 (mod 5) and n ≡ 3 (mod 7) can be combined by writing n = 1 + 5k|Hence n = 31 + 35t|Therefore n = 66 + 385s|For three-digit numbers, s = 1 or 2, giving n = 451 and n = 836|Directly, 451 = 11·41, 451 = 5·90 + 1 = 7·64 + 3|similarly, 836 = 11·76, 836 = 5·167 + 1 = 7·119 + 3",artifacts\phase2\phase2_verified_cot_luna_budget5_v1\raw_responses\sync\p2_r4_audit_train-007339_b_low_dc15c8e3bf16.json,afa2e14753efb8f7089dce8d32ca21e56da20f2e5e7fc11027fe4d1f002eda9a
